{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0075527","isObsolete":false,"name":"viral RNA editing","definition":{"text":"The process by which bases in viral mRNA are chemically altered during viral transcription. This is usually the incorporation of 1 - 6 additional nucleotides, which shifts the reading frame, allowing the generation of different protein products or through a specific nucleotide change that eliminates the termination codon.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"1629949"},{"dbCode":"VZ","dbId":"857"}]},"synonyms":[{"name":"RNA editing involved in viral mRNA transcription","type":"exact"}],"history":[{"timestamp":"2024-09-05","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2017-05-12","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044764 (obsolete multi-organism cellular process)"},{"timestamp":"2017-05-12","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044033 (obsolete multi-organism metabolic process)"},{"timestamp":"2017-05-12","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0009451 (RNA modification)"},{"timestamp":"2017-05-06","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044764 (obsolete multi-organism cellular process)"},{"timestamp":"2013-11-28","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044033 (obsolete multi-organism metabolic process)"},{"timestamp":"2013-07-13","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"part of GO:0019083 (viral transcription)"},{"timestamp":"2013-07-13","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0016032 (viral process)"},{"timestamp":"2013-07-13","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0009451 (RNA modification)"},{"timestamp":"2013-07-13","action":"Added","category":"XREF","text":"VZ:857"},{"timestamp":"2013-07-13","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"The process by which bases in viral mRNA are chemically altered during viral transcription. This is usually the incorporation of 1 - 6 additional nucleotid